---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import WaitlistModal from '../components/WaitlistModal.astro';
---

<Layout title="Health Disclaimer | diamo" description="Health disclaimer and medical advice notice for the diamo fitness app.">
  <Navbar />
  <main>
    <section class="legal section">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Back to Homepage</span>
        </a>

        <h1 class="legal-title">Health Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="legal-date-en">Last updated: September 2025</p>
        <p class="legal-date-de" id="disclaimer-de-date" style="display:none;">Stand: September 2025</p>

        <div class="legal-content">

          <div class="legal-section disclaimer-box">
            <p>
              <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> diamo is a fitness and wellness app, not a medical device.
              The information, recommendations, and content provided in the diamo app and on this
              website do not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>1. Not a Medical Device</h2>
            <p>
              diamo is designed to help users align their fitness and training with their menstrual
              cycle. The app provides general fitness recommendations, educational content about
              cycle phases, and activity tracking tools. It is <strong>not</strong> a medical device
              as defined by the EU Medical Device Regulation (MDR 2017/745) or equivalent regulations.
            </p>
            <p>
              The content provided in diamo — including workout recommendations, recovery suggestions,
              cycle-phase information, and knowledge drops — is for general informational and
              motivational purposes only.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>2. Consult Your Doctor</h2>
            <p>
              Before starting any new fitness program or making changes to your exercise routine,
              you should consult a qualified healthcare professional, especially if:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>You have or suspect you have a medical condition (e.g., PCOS, endometriosis, heart conditions, joint problems)</li>
              <li>You are pregnant or postpartum</li>
              <li>You are recovering from an injury or surgery</li>
              <li>You have been inactive for an extended period</li>
              <li>You experience unusual symptoms during or after exercise (e.g., chest pain, shortness of breath, dizziness)</li>
              <li>You are undergoing medical treatment or taking medication that may affect exercise</li>
              <li>You have irregular menstrual cycles or hormonal conditions</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              The recommendations in diamo are not a substitute for professional medical advice.
              Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider before
              acting on anything you read in the app.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>3. Cycle Tracking Is Not a Contraceptive Method</h2>
            <p>
              diamo tracks the menstrual cycle to help users optimize their training. The cycle
              tracking features in diamo are intended purely for fitness purposes and do <strong>not</strong>
              serve as a contraceptive method or fertility planning tool. diamo does not predict
              fertile windows for the purpose of birth control.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>4. Individual Variation</h2>
            <p>
              Every person's body is different. Responses to exercise, recovery needs, and cycle
              patterns vary significantly between individuals and can change over time. The general
              recommendations diamo provides are based on current sports science research and are
              intended as a starting point, not a rigid prescription.
            </p>
            <p>
              Always listen to your body. If a recommended workout feels too intense or causes
              pain, stop immediately and consult a professional.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>5. Limitation of Liability for Health-Related Decisions</h2>
            <p>
              By using diamo, you acknowledge and agree that:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>You are exercising voluntarily and assume all risks associated with your chosen activities</li>
              <li>diamo and its founder Lara Bullemer are not responsible for any injury, health deterioration, or adverse outcomes arising from the use of the app's recommendations</li>
              <li>You will use your own judgment and, where appropriate, seek professional guidance before following any recommendations in the app</li>
              <li>The information provided may not be applicable to your specific health situation</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              This limitation of liability does not apply in cases of intentional misconduct or gross
              negligence by diamo, nor for damages resulting from injury to life, body, or health.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>6. Accuracy of Information</h2>
            <p>
              We strive to ensure that the scientific and educational content in diamo (e.g., knowledge
              drops, cycle phase explanations) is accurate and based on current research. However,
              sports science and nutrition research evolves continuously. We cannot guarantee that
              all information is complete, up to date, or applicable to every individual.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you believe any content in the app contains a factual error, please contact us at
              <a href="mailto:hello@diamo.club">hello@diamo.club</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>7. Third-Party Wearable Data</h2>
            <p>
              diamo can connect to Apple Health and Google Health Connect to import health metrics
              (e.g., heart rate, sleep, steps). This data is used to enhance your training
              recommendations. However, diamo does not guarantee the accuracy of data from
              third-party devices. Fitness trackers and wearables may produce inaccurate readings,
              and any medical-grade interpretation of this data should be performed by a healthcare
              professional.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>8. Deutsch: Gesundheitshinweis</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>diamo ist kein Medizinprodukt</strong> und ersetzt keine ärztliche Beratung.
              Alle in der App angebotenen Trainingsempfehlungen, Informationen zu Zyklusphasen und
              Wissensinhalte dienen ausschließlich allgemeinen Informationszwecken. Sie stellen keine
              Diagnose, Behandlungsempfehlung oder Therapieanweisung dar.
            </p>
            <p>
              Vor Beginn eines neuen Trainingsprogramms wird empfohlen, ärztlichen Rat einzuholen,
              insbesondere bei bestehenden Erkrankungen, in der Schwangerschaft oder nach
              Verletzungen. Die Nutzung der App erfolgt auf eigene Verantwortung.
            </p>
            <p>
              diamo und Lara Bullemer übernehmen keine Haftung für gesundheitliche Schäden, die auf
              der Anwendung der App-Inhalte beruhen, soweit diese nicht auf Vorsatz oder grober
              Fahrlässigkeit beruhen. Die Haftung für Schäden an Leben, Körper oder Gesundheit,
              die auf einer fahrlässigen Pflichtverletzung beruhen, bleibt unberührt.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-section">
            <h2>9. Contact</h2>
            <p>
              Questions about this disclaimer:<br/>
              E-Mail: <a href="mailto:hello@diamo.club">hello@diamo.club</a><br/>
              Post: Lara Bullemer, diamo, Deimern 5, 29614 Soltau, Germany
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
  <WaitlistModal />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-2xl));
    min-height: 80vh;
  }

  .legal-date-en, .legal-date-de {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: -0.5rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover { color: var(--navy); }

  .legal-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .legal-content { max-width: 700px; }

  .disclaimer-box {
    background: #fff8e6;
    border: 1px solid #f5c842;
    border-left: 4px solid #f5c842;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl) !important;
  }

  .disclaimer-box p {
    color: #7a5c00 !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .legal-section { margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-sm) 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--lavender);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .legal-section a:hover { color: var(--navy); }
</style>
